% FP-power NLOS mitigation for UWB positioning (originally TELFOR 2017).
% Classifies LOS/NLOS/severe-NLOS from DW1000 first-path power; uses EKF for localization.
% arXiv preprint 2403.19706 is the 2024 upload of this 2017 conference paper.
% KEY RELEVANCE: same physical measurement (FP vs. total RX power); our contribution
% is reading both from the same RANGE_REPORT frame (tag-side, same link) rather than
% across different links, and integrating as a continuous weight rather than discrete class.
